              "customNotes": "Return up to three open Critical policy deviation actions only. Use clause name only as title, action label View Options, very short descriptions, copied priority fields, and prepared ora.Invoke('SendAgentCommandNoRefresh',...) commands exactly. Return raw oraInsight blocks only, with prepared followUpCommand and priority fields copied exactly."
